    "header_color": "magenta",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "FARE BELLA FIGURA is the most Italian",
          "of Italian concepts. It means:",
          "",
          "   presenting yourself well",
          "   making a good impression",
          "   showing respect through appearance",
          "   behaving with dignità",
          "",
          "It covers EVERYTHING:",
          "   how you dress (even for errands)",
          "   how you speak (register matters)",
          "   how you eat (never rush a meal)",
          "   how you host (generosity is key)",
          "   how your home looks (always tidy",
          "     when guests might come)",
          "",
          "FARE BRUTTA FIGURA = the opposite.",
          "Social death. Avoid at all costs."
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "RELATED CONCEPTS:",
          "",
          "ORGOGLIO = pride",
          "   pride in your origins, your town,",
          "   your family's cooking, your craft",
          "",
          "FURBIZIA = street-smart cunning",
          "   admired when clever, scorned",
          "   when dishonest — a fine line",
          "",
          "ARRANGIARSI = to make do",
          "   the art of getting by with what",
          "   you have — deeply Italian",
          "",
          "These aren't just words. They're",
          "cultural operating systems. Understand",
          "them and you understand Italy."
        ]
      }
